Following her nominations in all four of the Grammys&#8217; dance categories, Madonna has released a message about what this acknowledgment means to her.

&#8220;Dance is the hidden language of the soul,&#8221; Madonna wrote in a social media post tagging @Grammys, captioned &#8220;Incoming love letter.&#8221; &#8220;When I made C onfessions II with Stuart Price, our goal was not just to make people dance, but to find connection with other humans. If Storytelling is how we find our way back to ourselves then dancing is how we get there.

